msgid "Expert: write despite a different firmware version"
msgstr "Experte: trotz anderer Firmware-Version schreiben"

#: fm1companion/ui/pages/studio.py:216
msgid "The twin's data might not fit this version; without the tick the app writes nothing."
msgstr "Die Daten des Zwillings könnten zu dieser Version nicht passen; ohne Haken schreibt die App nichts."

#: fm1companion/ui/pages/studio.py:223
msgid "Make safety backup and write back"
